     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Cristina,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for your response.</div><div><br></div><div>I am going through the guide.</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve taken the following steps:<br></div><div><br></div><div>1. I&#39;ve installed R-3.2.2 and Rtools version 3.3.0.1958 </div><div><br></div><div>2. Install MS-MPI</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve got this site (<a href=\"https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831(v=vs.85).aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831(v%3Dvs.85).aspx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1pPsAJxkpY_BtNwI2wDG3W\">https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831(v=vs.85).aspx</a>) from the link (<span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Download Microsoft MPI, MS-MPI, (HPC Pack 2012 R2 MS-MPI\r\nRedistributable Package) from<span> </span></span><a href=\"http://http/www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://http/www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0a41MEDkDPQI_oTqGBvBSH\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Microsoft Developer Network</span></a><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">or<span><b> </b></span></span></span><a href=\"http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831%28v=vs.85%29.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831%2528v%3Dvs.85%2529.aspx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0n_jSLjX0zUmaoq_4noHRs\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><b>here</b></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">;<span> )</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span>The above address from </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><b> </b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><b><a href=\"http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831%28v=vs.85%29.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/bb524831%2528v%3Dvs.85%2529.aspx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0n_jSLjX0zUmaoq_4noHRs\">here</a>.</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">In this page, it says </span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Semibold&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">MS-MPI downloads<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:#2a2a2a\">The following are current downloads for MS-MPI:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;line-height:13.15pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://go.microsoft.com/FWLink/p/?LinkID=389556\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://go.microsoft.com/FWLink/p/?LinkID%3D389556&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0umxi1ZrW3smHiMRNQTLW5\"><span style=\"color:rgb(3,105,122)\">MS-MPI v6</span></a> (new!)\r\n     - see also the<a href=\"https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/mt147726(v=vs.85).aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/mt147726(v%3Dvs.85).aspx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xToSqpmMttN5Bv70YmVY0\"><span style=\"color:rgb(3,105,122)\"> Release\r\n     Notes</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:black;line-height:13.15pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(3,105,122)\"><a href=\"http://go.microsoft.com/FWLink/p/?LinkID=390711\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://go.microsoft.com/FWLink/p/?LinkID%3D390711&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858839000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CJMjsJL4FgvAsvy2tjWOH\">Debugger\r\n     for MS-MPI Applications with HPC Pack 2012 </a>R2</span></span></li></ul><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\">Should I need to install both (the two dot points).</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\">Please guide me.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\">Regards,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\">Deb</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#03697a\" face=\"Segoe UI, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;line-height:17.5333px\"><br></span></font></div></span></div><div></div></div>"
