.org/web/packages/pbdMPI/vignettes/pbdMPI-guide.pdf</a></div><div><br></div><div>Best regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Cristina</div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2015-09-30 6:04 GMT+02:00 Deb Midya <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">midy...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance.</div><div><br></div><div>I am new to pbdR and need your help to start with.</div><div><br></div><div>I have installed R-3.2.2 and Rtools on 64-bit Windows (Windows 10).</div><div><br></div><div>Should I need to install Microsoft MPI (or any others)? May I request you to give me step-by-step approach to start with pbdR please?</div><div><br></div><div>Once again, thank you very much for the time you have given.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Deb</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nProgramming with Big Data in R<br>\r\n       Simplifying Scalability <br>\r\n              <a href=\"http://r-pbd.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-pbd.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244858847000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2amdcV_vyiOGmRh6gHcb04\">http://r-pbd.org/</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;RBigDataProgramming&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">rbigdataprogramming+unsub...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">rbigdatap...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rbigdataprogramming\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"h